Aim: Find the square of a number using a method.

Algorithm: Start
pass number to square method
calculate n*n
display
stop.

Program:

class SquareDemo {
    static int square(int n) { return n*n; }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Square = " + square(5));
    }
}

Result: Square = 25

